          "Bergmann's rule (size) + Allen's rule (limb length)"
        ],
        [
          "Understand why race fails as biology",
          "Lewontin + clinal variation + trait non-concordance"
        ],
        [
          "Explain why humans have long childhoods",
          "Life history theory — brain development cost"
        ],
        [
          "Explain menopause",
